{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Do not move</b> — a second time, on account of 'and do not enter the field of orphans.' The meaning of 'do not enter' is: do not enter his field to harvest its produce, or do not enter it by force — for HaShem, who is their redeemer, who will redeem the field from your hand, is strong, so that you will not stand before Him."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:18.649218761Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}